    <bpmn:userTask id="U" camunda:assignee="demo" camunda:candidateGroups="g" camunda:formRef="f" camunda:formRefBinding="latest" camunda:priority="${p}"><bpmn:extensionElements><camunda:taskListener event="create" expression="${true}"><camunda:field name="f" stringValue="v" /></camunda:taskListener></bpmn:extensionElements><bpmn:multiInstanceLoopCharacteristics camunda:collection="${items}" camunda:elementVariable="item" /></bpmn:userTask>
    <bpmn:callActivity id="C" calledElement="Other" camunda:calledElementBinding="latest"><bpmn:extensionElements><camunda:in variables="all" /><camunda:out source="a" target="b" /><camunda:in businessKey="${k}" /></bpmn:extensionElements></bpmn:callActivity>
    <bpmn:businessRuleTask id="R" camunda:decisionRef="d" camunda:resultVariable="r" camunda:mapDecisionResult="singleResult" />
